  "text": "Here is how top remote-first companies ship twice as fast by completely ditching live meetings. Coordinating live calendars burns hours of administrative overhead and fragments your engineering team's focus time. When discussions happen exclusively on calls, critical context vanishes instead of remaining searchable for other team members. Shift all product discussions into asynchronous Loom recordings embedded directly within Notion project documentation. You unlock faster sprint cycles and permanent institutional knowledge.",
